\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/03\\/10022024-10022024-_78A7536-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/03\\/10022024-10022024-_78A7536-600x400.jpg 600w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\\\" \\/><\\/figure>\\n\\n\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t \\r\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\r\\n\\t\\n \\r\\n\\t\\t\\t\\r\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\r\\n\\t\\n\\n\\r\\n\\t\\t<div  class=\\\"block-dd77c0dc-9888-4862-8c6d-05e46e6b72ae col areoi-element\\\">\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t\\n\\r\\n\\t\\t<div  class=\\\"block-2ef2d654-9590-4327-a3ab-6f953c0a1263 areoi-element content-history\\\">\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t\\r\\n\\t\\t<div class=\\\"areoi-background  \\\">\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"container-fluid\\\" style=\\\"padding: 0;\\\">\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"row justify-content-start\\\">\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"col \\\">\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t            <div class=\\\"areoi-background__color\\\" \\r\\n\\t                        \\tstyle=\\\"background: rgba(240, 237, 236,1)\\\">\\r\\n\\t                        <\\/div>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\t                    \\r\\n\\r\\n\\t                    \\r\\n\\r\\n\\t                    \\r\\n\\t    \\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\r\\n\\t    \\t\\t<\\/div>\\r\\n\\t    \\t<\\/div>\\r\\n\\t    <\\/div>\\r\\n\\t\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t\\n\\n<figure class=\\\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized img-absolute\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" width=\\\"433\\\" height=\\\"414\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/10\\/star.png\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-112\\\" style=\\\"width:50px;height:auto\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/10\\/star.png 433w, https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/10\\/star-300x287.png 300w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 433px) 100vw, 433px\\\" \\/><\\/figure>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"has-text-align-center text-justify has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-1 wp-block-paragraph\\\" style=\\\"color:#2c2e35\\\" data-aos=\\\"zoom-in\\\" data-aos-delay=\\\"300\\\" data-aos-duration=\\\"950\\\">La Federaci\\u00f3 Catalana de Patinatge \\u00e9s una entitat privada d&#8217;utilitat p\\u00fablica i d&#8217;inter\\u00e8s c\\u00edvic i social, constitu\\u00efda per associacions, clubs i agrupacions esportives que es dediquen o participen a l\\u2019exercici de l\\u2019esport del patinatge sobre rodes en 11 disciplines <strong>(Hoquei Patins, Patinatge Art\\u00edstic, Patinatge Velocitat, Hoquei L\\u00ednia, Roller Freestyle, Roller Derby, Skateboarding, Alp\\u00ed en l\\u00ednia, Descens i Scootering)<\\/strong> amb l\\u2019objectiu de promocionar, organitzar, gestionar i coordinar la seva pr\\u00e0ctica dins l\\u2019\\u00e0mbit de Catalunya, sense afany lucratiu.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t \\r\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\r\\n\\t\\n \\r\\n\\t\\t\\t\\r\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\r\\n\\t\\n \\r\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\r\\n\\t\\n \\r\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\r\\n\\t\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-genesis-blocks-gb-spacer gb-block-spacer gb-divider-solid gb-divider-size-1\\\" style=\\\"color:#ddd\\\"><hr style=\\\"height:40px\\\"\\/><\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\r\\n\\t\\t<div  class=\\\"block-d35c0ad0-1d3e-4254-9846-15c5bc1185b6 areoi-element container\\\">\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t\\n\\r\\n\\t\\t<div data-aos-duration=\\\"1050\\\" data-aos=\\\"fade-right\\\"  class=\\\"block-efe7560f-42ca-438d-acc0-3e354e705b3e row areoi-element heading-content\\\">\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t\\r\\n\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t\\n\\r\\n\\t\\t<div  class=\\\"block-8d188db2-bbf5-4189-bdd0-f00100793831 col areoi-element\\\">\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t\\n\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading heading-sections heading-sections__bg\\\">Propers<br><span style=\\\"color: #e2231a; display:contents;\\\">Esdeveniments<\\/span><\\/h2>\\n\\n \\r\\n\\t\\t\\t\\r\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\r\\n\\t\\n \\r\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\r\\n\\t\\n \\r\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\r\\n\\t\\n\\n    <section data-aos-delay=\\\"250\\\" data-aos-duration=\\\"1050\\\" data-aos=\\\"zoom-in\\\" id=\\\"block_3f5924e7abab48b1a19a36aaf0eb0d9f\\\"\\r\\n        class=\\\"general-fcp esdeveniments-list alignwide \\\">\\r\\n        <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\r\\n            <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\r\\n                <div class=\\\"list-esdeveniments-slider\\\">\\r\\n                                                                        <div id_post=\\\"59019\\\" class=\\\"item-esdeveniments\\\">\\r\\n                                <div class=\\\"item-esdeveniments-inner\\\">\\r\\n                                    <div class=\\\"item-esdeveniments-img\\\">\\r\\n                                        <a>\\r\\n                                                                                            <img decoding=\\\"async\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/10\\/CARTELL_J1_STREET-1-1-scaled.jpg\\\"\\r\\n                                                    alt=\\\"Lliga Catalana d&#8217;Skateboaring (1a Jornada)\\\">\\r\\n                                                                                    <\\/a>\\r\\n                                    <\\/div>\\r\\n                                    <div class=\\\"item-esdeveniments-content\\\">\\r\\n                                        <span>14\\/11\\/2026<\\/span>\\r\\n                                        <h4 class=\\\"item-esdeveniments-title\\\">\\r\\n                                            <a>Lliga Catalana d&#8217;Skateboaring (1a Jornada)<\\/a>\\r\\n                                        <\\/h4>\\r\\n                                    <\\/div>\\r\\n                                <\\/div>\\r\\n                            <\\/div>\\r\\n                                                    <div id_post=\\\"58872\\\" class=\\\"item-esdeveniments\\\">\\r\\n                                <div class=\\\"item-esdeveniments-inner\\\">\\r\\n                                    <div class=\\\"item-esdeveniments-img\\\">\\r\\n                                        <a>\\r\\n                                                                                            <img decoding=\\\"async\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/10\\/CARTELL_DINA4_2-scaled.png\\\"\\r\\n                                                    alt=\\\"IX Catalunya Stars\\\">\\r\\n                                                                                    <\\/a>\\r\\n                                    <\\/div>\\r\\n                                    <div class=\\\"item-esdeveniments-content\\\">\\r\\n                                        <span>21\\/11\\/2026<\\/span>\\r\\n                                        <h4 class=\\\"item-esdeveniments-title\\\">\\r\\n                                            <a>IX Catalunya Stars<\\/a>\\r\\n                                        <\\/h4>\\r\\n                                    <\\/div>\\r\\n                                <\\/div>\\r\\n                            <\\/div>\\r\\n                                                    <div id_post=\\\"59177\\\" class=\\\"item-esdeveniments\\\">\\r\\n                                <div class=\\\"item-esdeveniments-inner\\\">\\r\\n                                    <div class=\\\"item-esdeveniments-img\\\">\\r\\n                                        <a>\\r\\n                                                                                            <img decoding=\\\"async\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/11\\/LLIGA_FREESTYLE_J1_DINA4-1-1-scaled.png\\\"\\r\\n                                                    alt=\\\"1a Jornada Lliga Catalana d\\u2019Inline Freestyle 2026-27\\\">\\r\\n                                                                                    <\\/a>\\r\\n                                    <\\/div>\\r\\n                                    <div class=\\\"item-esdeveniments-content\\\">\\r\\n                                        <span>21\\/11\\/2026<\\/span>\\r\\n                                        <h4 class=\\\"item-esdeveniments-title\\\">\\r\\n                                            <a>1a Jornada Lliga Catalana d\\u2019Inline Freestyle 2026-27<\\/a>\\r\\n                                        <\\/h4>\\r\\n                                    <\\/div>\\r\\n                                <\\/div>\\r\\n                            <\\/div>\\r\\n                                                            <\\/div>\\r\\n            <\\/div>\\r\\n        <\\/div>\\r\\n    <\\/section>\\r\\n\\r\\n    <script>\\r\\n        jQuery(document).ready(function ($) {\\r\\n            $('.list-esdeveniments-slider').slick({\\r\\n                slidesToShow: 3,\\r\\n                slidesToScroll: 1,\\r\\n                autoplay: true,\\r\\n                autoplaySpeed: 5000,\\r\\n                arrows: true,\\r\\n                dots: false,\\r\\n                infinite: true,\\r\\n                adaptiveHeight: true,\\r\\n                speed: 500,\\r\\n                cssEase: 'linear',\\r\\n                lazyLoad: 'ondemand',\\r\\n                responsive: [\\r\\n                    {\\r\\n                        breakpoint: 768,\\r\\n                        settings: {\\r\\n                            slidesToShow: 2,\\r\\n                            slidesToScroll: 1,\\r\\n                            infinite: true,\\r\\n                        }\\r\\n                    },\\r\\n                    {\\r\\n                        breakpoint: 576,\\r\\n                        settings: {\\r\\n                            slidesToShow: 1,\\r\\n                            slidesToScroll: 1,\\r\\n                            infinite: true,\\r\\n                        }\\r\\n                    }\\r\\n                ]\\r\\n            });\\r\\n\\r\\n            \\/\\/ Function to set equal heights\\r\\n            function setEqualHeights() {\\r\\n                var maxHeight = 0;\\r\\n                $('.item-esdeveniments-content').each(function () {\\r\\n                    var thisHeight = $(this).outerHeight();\\r\\n                    if (thisHeight > maxHeight) {\\r\\n                        maxHeight = thisHeight;\\r\\n                    }\\r\\n                });\\r\\n                $('.item-esdeveniments-content').css('height', maxHeight + 'px');\\r\\n            }\\r\\n\\r\\n            setEqualHeights();\\r\\n\\r\\n            $(window).on('resize', function () {\\r\\n                $('.item-esdeveniments-content').css('height', '');\\r\\n                setEqualHeights();\\r\\n            });\\r\\n\\r\\n            $('.list-esdeveniments-slider').on('setPosition', function () {\\r\\n                $('.item-esdeveniments-content').css('height', '');\\r\\n                setEqualHeights();\\r\\n            });\\r\\n        });\\r\\n    <\\/script>\\r\\n\\r\\n    \\n\\n\\r\\n\\t\\t<div  class=\\\"block-5e4422c2-f407-4a8b-8b91-fa83409d1610 areoi-element container\\\">\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t\\n\\r\\n\\t\\t<div data-aos-delay=\\\"100\\\" data-aos-duration=\\\"1050\\\" data-aos=\\\"fade-right\\\"  class=\\\"block-161171e7-493d-40a6-9522-1501839051c8 row areoi-element heading-content\\\">\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t\\r\\n\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t\\n\\r\\n\\t\\t<div  class=\\\"block-9ecde3b9-464c-4de2-9944-58620b9e42d6 col areoi-element\\\">\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t\\r\\n\\t\\t\\t\\n\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading heading-sections heading-sections__bg heading-sections__bg--gray\\\">ACTUALITAT<\\/h2>\\n\\n \\r\\n\\t\\t\\t\\r\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\r\\n\\t\\n \\r\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\r\\n\\t\\n \\r\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\r\\n\\t\\n\\n\\n<h6 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\"><\\/h6>\\n\\n\\n    <section data-aos-delay=\\\"300\\\" data-aos-duration=\\\"1050\\\" data-aos=\\\"zoom-in\\\" id=\\\"block_fc9b53ac95cd620292e7e95b0880c5a9\\\"\\n        class=\\\"general-fcp slider_actualitat-list alignfull \\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"slider-noticies-actualitat\\\">\\n                \\n\\n                                                <div id_post=\\\"59373\\\" class=\\\"item-noticia-slide\\\">\\n                                <div class=\\\"row item-noticia-slide-inner\\\">\\n                                    <div class=\\\"col-12 col-lg-7 item-noticia-slide-img\\\">\\n                                        <div class=\\\"div-img\\\">\\n                                            <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/noticia\\/tortosa-acull-la-primera-jornada-de-la-lliga-catalana-dstreet\\/\\\">\\n                                                <img decoding=\\\"async\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/11\\/foto-street-1.png\\\"\\n                                                alt=\\\"Tortosa acull la primera jornada de la Lliga Catalana d&#8217;Street\\\"\\n                                                class=\\\"image-orientation--horizontal\\\">\\n                                            <\\/a>\\n                                        <\\/div>\\n                                    <\\/div>\\n                                    <div class=\\\"col-12 col-lg-5 item-noticia-slide-content\\\">\\n                                        <div class=\\\"content-items\\\">\\n                                            <div class=\\\"content-title\\\">\\n                                                <img decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"img-title\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/wp-content\\/themes\\/genesis-child\\/assets\\/img\\/star-red.png\\\"\\n                                                    alt=\\\"icona actualitat\\\">\\n                                                <h4 class=\\\"item-noticia-slide-title\\\">\\n                                                    <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/noticia\\/tortosa-acull-la-primera-jornada-de-la-lliga-catalana-dstreet\\/\\\">\\n                                                        Tortosa acull la primera jornada de la Lliga Catalana d&#8217;Street                                                    <\\/a>\\n                                                <\\/h4>\\n                                            <\\/div>\\n\\n\\n                                            <div class=\\\"item-noticia-slide-excerpt\\\">\\n                                                La temporada d&#8217;Skate ja ha comen\\u00e7at amb la competici\\u00f3 disputada aquest cap de setmana a Tortosa. Tot i que una part de la jornada es va veure afectada per la pluja, la competici\\u00f3 va ser tot un \\u00e8xit, amb un alt nivell esportiu sobre la pista i una gran participaci\\u00f3. Joel Serra lidera la classificaci\\u00f3 [&hellip;]                                            <\\/div>\\n                                            <div class=\\\"item-noticia-slide-link\\\">\\n                                                <a class=\\\"btn-fcp-red\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/noticia\\/tortosa-acull-la-primera-jornada-de-la-lliga-catalana-dstreet\\/\\\">LLEGIR M\\u00c9S<\\/a>\\n                                            <\\/div>\\n                                        <\\/div>\\n                                    <\\/div>\\n                                <\\/div>\\n                            <\\/div>\\n                                                <div id_post=\\\"59300\\\" class=\\\"item-noticia-slide\\\">\\n                                <div class=\\\"row item-noticia-slide-inner\\\">\\n                                    <div class=\\\"col-12 col-lg-7 item-noticia-slide-img\\\">\\n                                        <div class=\\\"div-img\\\">\\n                                            <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/noticia\\/vilafranca-i-bell-lloc-lideren-la-classificacio-de-la-nacional-catalana\\/\\\">\\n                                                <img decoding=\\\"async\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/11\\/DSC05028-Mejorado-NR-scaled.jpg\\\"\\n                                                alt=\\\"Vilafranca i Bell-lloc lideren la classificaci\\u00f3 de la Nacional Catalana\\\"\\n                                                class=\\\"image-orientation--horizontal\\\">\\n                                            <\\/a>\\n                                        <\\/div>\\n                                    <\\/div>\\n                                    <div class=\\\"col-12 col-lg-5 item-noticia-slide-content\\\">\\n                                        <div class=\\\"content-items\\\">\\n                                            <div class=\\\"content-title\\\">\\n                                                <img decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"img-title\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/wp-content\\/themes\\/genesis-child\\/assets\\/img\\/star-red.png\\\"\\n                                                    alt=\\\"icona actualitat\\\">\\n                                                <h4 class=\\\"item-noticia-slide-title\\\">\\n                                                    <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/noticia\\/vilafranca-i-bell-lloc-lideren-la-classificacio-de-la-nacional-catalana\\/\\\">\\n                                                        Vilafranca i Bell-lloc lideren la classificaci\\u00f3 de la Nacional Catalana                                                    <\\/a>\\n                                                <\\/h4>\\n                                            <\\/div>\\n\\n\\n                                            <div class=\\\"item-noticia-slide-excerpt\\\">\\n                                                El passat cap de setmana es va disputar la 7\\u00aa jornada de la m\\u00e0xima competici\\u00f3 catalana d\\u2019hoquei patins. A la competici\\u00f3 femenina, el CP Vilafranca es consoliden com a primeres, mentra d\\u2019altra banda, en la competici\\u00f3 masculina, el CP Bell-loc mant\\u00e9 la primera posici\\u00f3 en solitari amb un ple de vict\\u00f2ries i tres punts de [&hellip;]                                            <\\/div>\\n                                            <div class=\\\"item-noticia-slide-link\\\">\\n                                                <a class=\\\"btn-fcp-red\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/noticia\\/vilafranca-i-bell-lloc-lideren-la-classificacio-de-la-nacional-catalana\\/\\\">LLEGIR M\\u00c9S<\\/a>\\n                                            <\\/div>\\n                                        <\\/div>\\n                                    <\\/div>\\n                                <\\/div>\\n                            <\\/div>\\n                                                <div id_post=\\\"59290\\\" class=\\\"item-noticia-slide\\\">\\n                                <div class=\\\"row item-noticia-slide-inner\\\">\\n                                    <div class=\\\"col-12 col-lg-7 item-noticia-slide-img\\\">\\n                                        <div class=\\\"div-img\\\">\\n                                            <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/noticia\\/ja-tenim-els-horaris-i-ordres-de-sortida-del-ix-catalunya-stars\\/\\\">\\n                                                <img decoding=\\\"async\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/11\\/PetidierPhoto-60.jpg\\\"\\n                                                alt=\\\"Ja tenim els horaris i ordres de sortida del IX Catalunya Stars!\\\"\\n                                                class=\\\"image-orientation--horizontal\\\">\\n                                            <\\/a>\\n                                        <\\/div>\\n                                    <\\/div>\\n                                    <div class=\\\"col-12 col-lg-5 item-noticia-slide-content\\\">\\n                                        <div class=\\\"content-items\\\">\\n                                            <div class=\\\"content-title\\\">\\n                                                <img decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"img-title\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/wp-content\\/themes\\/genesis-child\\/assets\\/img\\/star-red.png\\\"\\n                                                    alt=\\\"icona actualitat\\\">\\n                                                <h4 class=\\\"item-noticia-slide-title\\\">\\n                                                    <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/noticia\\/ja-tenim-els-horaris-i-ordres-de-sortida-del-ix-catalunya-stars\\/\\\">\\n                                                        Ja tenim els horaris i ordres de sortida del IX Catalunya Stars!                                                    <\\/a>\\n                                                <\\/h4>\\n                                            <\\/div>\\n\\n\\n                                            <div class=\\\"item-noticia-slide-excerpt\\\">\\n                                                Com ja hem estat anunciant aquests darrers dies, el 21 de novembre Fontajau ser\\u00e0 la seu del patinatge art\\u00edstic, i ja en sabem els horaris. Ser\\u00e0 una jornada plena d&#8217;emoci\\u00f3, que obrir\\u00e0 les seves portes a les 15:15h. Tot i aix\\u00ed, estarem abans preparant-ho tot i us podeu passar i adquirir el pelux de la [&hellip;]                                            <\\/div>\\n                                            <div class=\\\"item-noticia-slide-link\\\">\\n                                                <a class=\\\"btn-fcp-red\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/noticia\\/ja-tenim-els-horaris-i-ordres-de-sortida-del-ix-catalunya-stars\\/\\\">LLEGIR M\\u00c9S<\\/a>\\n                                            <\\/div>\\n                                        <\\/div>\\n                                    <\\/div>\\n                                <\\/div>\\n                            <\\/div>\\n                                                <div id_post=\\\"59212\\\" class=\\\"item-noticia-slide\\\">\\n                                <div class=\\\"row item-noticia-slide-inner\\\">\\n                                    <div class=\\\"col-12 col-lg-7 item-noticia-slide-img\\\">\\n                                        <div class=\\\"div-img\\\">\\n                                            <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/noticia\\/girona-presenta-el-catalunya-stars-2026-la-gran-festa-del-patinatge-artistic-catala\\/\\\">\\n                                                <img decoding=\\\"async\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/11\\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-11-09-at-15.58.15-scaled.jpeg\\\"\\n                                                alt=\\\"Girona presenta el Catalunya Stars 2026, la gran festa del patinatge art\\u00edstic catal\\u00e0\\\"\\n                                                class=\\\"image-orientation--horizontal\\\">\\n                                            <\\/a>\\n                                        <\\/div>\\n                                    <\\/div>\\n                                    <div class=\\\"col-12 col-lg-5 item-noticia-slide-content\\\">\\n                                        <div class=\\\"content-items\\\">\\n                                            <div class=\\\"content-title\\\">\\n                                                <img decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"img-title\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/wp-content\\/themes\\/genesis-child\\/assets\\/img\\/star-red.png\\\"\\n                                                    alt=\\\"icona actualitat\\\">\\n                                                <h4 class=\\\"item-noticia-slide-title\\\">\\n                                                    <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/noticia\\/girona-presenta-el-catalunya-stars-2026-la-gran-festa-del-patinatge-artistic-catala\\/\\\">\\n                                                        Girona presenta el Catalunya Stars 2026, la gran festa del patinatge art\\u00edstic catal\\u00e0                                                    <\\/a>\\n                                                <\\/h4>\\n                                            <\\/div>\\n\\n\\n                                            <div class=\\\"item-noticia-slide-excerpt\\\">\\n                                                La novena edici\\u00f3 se celebrar\\u00e0 el 21 de novembre a Fontajau, amb tres equips capitanejats per parelles de refer\\u00e8ncia mundial i una previsi\\u00f3 de m\\u00e9s de 5.000 espectadors. L&#8217;Ajuntament de Girona ha acollit aquest dilluns la presentaci\\u00f3 de la novena edici\\u00f3 del Catalunya Stars, que se celebrar\\u00e0 el pr\\u00f2xim 21 de novembre al pavell\\u00f3 de [&hellip;]                                            <\\/div>\\n                                            <div class=\\\"item-noticia-slide-link\\\">\\n                                                <a class=\\\"btn-fcp-red\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/noticia\\/girona-presenta-el-catalunya-stars-2026-la-gran-festa-del-patinatge-artistic-catala\\/\\\">LLEGIR M\\u00c9S<\\/a>\\n                                            <\\/div>\\n                                        <\\/div>\\n                                    <\\/div>\\n                                <\\/div>\\n                            <\\/div>\\n                                                <div id_post=\\\"59175\\\" class=\\\"item-noticia-slide\\\">\\n                                <div class=\\\"row item-noticia-slide-inner\\\">\\n                                    <div class=\\\"col-12 col-lg-7 item-noticia-slide-img\\\">\\n                                        <div class=\\\"div-img\\\">\\n                                            <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/noticia\\/arrenca-la-lliga-catalana-dinline-freestyle-2026-27\\/\\\">\\n                                                <img decoding=\\\"async\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/11\\/LLIGA_FREESTYLE_J1_DINA4-1-scaled.png\\\"\\n                                                alt=\\\"Arrenca la Lliga Catalana d\\u2019Inline Freestyle 2026-27\\\"\\n                                                class=\\\"image-orientation--vertical\\\">\\n                                            <\\/a>\\n                                        <\\/div>\\n                                    <\\/div>\\n                                    <div class=\\\"col-12 col-lg-5 item-noticia-slide-content\\\">\\n                                        <div class=\\\"content-items\\\">\\n                                            <div class=\\\"content-title\\\">\\n                                                <img decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"img-title\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/wp-content\\/themes\\/genesis-child\\/assets\\/img\\/star-red.png\\\"\\n                                                    alt=\\\"icona actualitat\\\">\\n                                                <h4 class=\\\"item-noticia-slide-title\\\">\\n                                                    <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.fcpatinatge.cat\\/noticia\\/arrenca-la-lliga-catalana-dinline-freestyle-2026-27\\/\\\">\\n                                                        Arrenca la Lliga Catalana d\\u2019Inline Freestyle 2026-27                                                    <\\/a>\\n                                                <\\/h4>\\n                                            <\\/div>\\n\\n\\n                                            <div class=\\\"item-noticia-slide-excerpt\\\">\\n                                                La primera jornada de la compe